{"id":"n60202-1-7","stage":1,"title":"볶음밥 · 炒饭","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60202-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 점심은 뭘로 먹을까?","zh":"今天午饭吃什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심은","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭘로","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ로：로/으로的口语缩合形式；뭘로相当于무엇으로，表示用什么、以什么等。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/57f796734a439d05a56d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60202-1-7-2","ko":"해물이 들어간 볶음밥 어때?","zh":"加了海鲜的炒饭怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"해물이","meaning":"海产品","explanation":"해물：海产品；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"해물","audio":"/audio/f6cb48635568decd01fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85355","senseId":"1","lemma":"해물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어간","meaning":"包含，插入，夹进","explanation":"들어가다：包含，插入，夹进；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"5","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볶음밥","meaning":"炒饭","explanation":"볶음밥：炒饭","readings":[{"term":"볶음밥","audio":"/audio/f21a0587877f1d7f4cfe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60202","senseId":"1","lemma":"볶음밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f6cb48635568decd","term":"해물","zh":"海产品","audio":"/audio/f6cb48635568decd01fc.mp3","entryId":"85355","definition":"来自海洋的所有动植物。","pronunciation":["해ː물"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"包含，插入，夹进","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"被插到某物内。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"f21a0587877f1d7f","term":"볶음밥","zh":"炒饭","audio":"/audio/f21a0587877f1d7f4cfe.mp3","entryId":"60202","definition":"把蔬菜或肉类等切细了放到饭里、用油炒成的食物。","pronunciation":["보끔밥"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3c8086c123fdf113999a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.613,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60202","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequen